@startuml tailscale-architecture-overview
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Phone\n(Tailscale client)" as Phone
cloud "Tailscale Cloud" {
  component "Coordination Server\n(control.ts)" as Control
  component "DERP Relay\n(fallback only)" as Derp
}
node "Home Cluster\n(Tailscale client)" as Cluster

Phone <..> Control : HTTPS REST\n(control plane only,\nnever in data path)
Cluster <..> Control

Phone <..> Derp : encrypted relay\n(used only if direct fails)
Cluster <..> Derp

Phone <-> Cluster : direct WireGuard UDP\n(preferred data path)

note right of Control
  Distributes: public keys,
  peer endpoints, DERP region
  assignments, ACL/route policy
end note

note right of Derp
  Still end-to-end encrypted -
  DERP only proxies ciphertext
end note
@enduml
